// title: Exploring M365 Accounts Investigation
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: AuditLogs, CloudAppEvents, SigninLogs
// purpose: Exploring M365 Accounts Investigation
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Exploring%20M365%20Accounts%20Investigation.kql
